9R).\n\n**No error_methodology_ids in the supplied package.**\n\n---\n\n# 5. Strongest contrary or mitigating evidence\n\n- **Nuclear arsenal and intent:** WEB-001R (FAS) and the official Chinese no-first-use declaration (Chinese MoND 2023b, as quoted) are mitigating. China's arsenal remained smaller than US/Russian arsenals in 2023; the November arms-control engagement is a tangible de-escalation step. **Disposition: final_evidence**.\n- **2023 adaptation:** WEB-015R (PRC Leader) and the public pivot to growth can be read as pragmatic adaptation. **Disposition: final_evidence**.\n- **Military communications restored:** WEB-005aR is genuinely risk-reducing in a tense year. **Disposition: final_evidence**.\n- **Counter-espionage law as security:** WEB-025R could be defended as a national-security measure; HRW, Amnesty, US Department of State, and DOJ all interpret it as widening state control. **Disposition: final_evidence for the law itself, context for the alternative framing**.\n- **Li Keqiang mourning episode:** WEB-030R documents a rare 2023 episode of public criticism tolerated. This is contrary to the dominant repression pattern and is documented. **Disposition: final_evidence**.\n- **NO-FIRST-USE reaffirmation:** WEB-001R quotes the 2023 Chinese MoND defense policy reaffirming NFU. This is a strong positive 1B.2 fact. **Disposition: final_evidence**.\n\n---\n\n# 6. Rejected candidates (with reason)\n\n- **Bloomberg 6 Jan 2024 missile-procurement article (Martin and Jacobs 2024):** Not directly opened in this run; cited via FAS. Use WEB-002R as the secondary characterization and label as context.\n- **PRC MOFA readout of the 6 Nov 2023 meeting:** The ACA article paraphrases the Chinese MFA position; I did not directly open the MFA press release. Use the ACA paraphrase as final_evidence and treat the MFA as a gateway context.\n- **The IMF Article IV 2023 full report:** The IMF PDF returned a 403 in this run; the press release URL also returned 403. I do not hav